+/**
+ * skb_set_transport_header_careful - conditionally set transport header
+ * @skb: buffer to alter
+ * @offset: offset to add to skb->data
+ *
+ * Hardened version of skb_set_transport_header().
+ *
+ * Returns: true if the operation was a success.
